cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Invigil, please cite it using this file."
type: software
title: "Invigil: passive wireless detection of hidden cheating devices in exam halls"
abstract: >-
  Invigil detects hidden phones, Bluetooth earpieces and smartwatches in exam
  halls by listening passively to the 2.4 GHz band. One Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W
  unit with an nRF24L01+PA+LNA radio sends its readings over Wi-Fi and MQTT to
  a laptop, where a model reports the device type and the distance band.
  Grade 12 STEM capstone, team 12323.
